<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Step 4 — ABC-MCMC</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #17202a;
      --muted: #5f6b76;
      --line: #dce2e7;
      --panel: #ffffff;
      --page: #f4f6f8;
      --accent: #285f8f;
      --accent-soft: #eaf1f7;
      --success: #1f6b4f;
      --success-soft: #e8f4ee;
      --warning: #7a5410;
      --code: #111820;
      --shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(23, 32, 42, 0.07);
      --radius: 14px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--page);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    main {
      width: min(1480px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 44px 0 64px;
    }

    header {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: end;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 750;
      letter-spacing: 0.11em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 { line-height: 1.18; }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 900px;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.55rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .lede {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.04rem;
    }

    button {
      border: 1px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--accent);
      font: inherit;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    button:hover { filter: brightness(0.95); }
    button:disabled { opacity: 0.55; cursor: progress; }

    .status {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 48px;
      margin: 0 0 22px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--panel);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .status-dot {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--warning);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(122, 84, 16, 0.12);
    }

    .status.complete .status-dot {
      background: var(--success);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(31, 107, 79, 0.12);
    }

    .scope-note {
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
      background: var(--accent-soft);
    }

    .scope-note strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }

    .panel {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--panel);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .panel-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: start;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.35rem; }
    h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1rem; }

    .panel-head p,
    .small-note {
      margin: 6px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .scenario-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .scenario-card {
      min-width: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .scenario-meta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 14px 15px 0;
    }

    .parameters {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
    }

    .chart { width: 100%; height: 405px; }

    .table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }

    th, td {
      padding: 12px 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: top;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    th {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }

    .pass {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 4px 9px;
      color: var(--success);
      background: var(--success-soft);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .interpretation {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .interpretation article {
      padding: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #fbfcfd;
    }

    .interpretation p { margin: 7px 0 0; color: var(--muted); }

    details {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #fbfcfd;
    }

    details + details { margin-top: 12px; }

    summary {
      padding: 13px 15px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    pre {
      max-height: 620px;
      margin: 0;
      overflow: auto;
      border-radius: 0 0 9px 9px;
      padding: 18px;
      color: #e9eef3;
      background: var(--code);
      font: 0.82rem/1.55 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      tab-size: 2;
      white-space: pre;
    }

    .formula {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .formula div {
      padding: 13px 15px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      background: #f6f8fa;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    }

    .observed-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.7fr) minmax(300px, 0.8fr);
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .observed-chart {
      min-height: 470px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .summary-stack {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
      align-content: start;
    }

    .summary-card {
      padding: 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #fbfcfd;
    }

    .summary-card.accent {
      border-color: rgba(40, 95, 143, 0.32);
      background: var(--accent-soft);
    }

    .summary-card h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; }

    .stat-list {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 8px 14px;
      margin: 0;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }

    .stat-list dt { color: var(--muted); }
    .stat-list dd { margin: 0; font-weight: 800; }

    .vector {
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 11px 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(40, 95, 143, 0.18);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
      font: 0.9rem/1.45 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .fixed-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 5px 10px;
      color: var(--success);
      background: var(--success-soft);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .fixed-badge::before {
      content: "";
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--success);
    }



    .header-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .button-secondary {
      color: var(--accent);
      background: #fff;
    }

    .abc-controls {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(240px, 0.8fr) minmax(320px, 1.4fr) repeat(3, minmax(130px, 0.55fr));
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: stretch;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .control-card,
    .metric-card {
      min-width: 0;
      padding: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 11px;
      background: #fbfcfd;
    }

    .control-card > label,
    .control-card > .control-label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 9px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.055em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .segmented {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 4px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .segmented label {
      position: relative;
      display: block;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .segmented input {
      position: absolute;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .segmented span {
      display: block;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .segmented input:checked + span {
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--accent);
    }

    .range-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    input[type="range"] {
      width: 100%;
      accent-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .epsilon-readout {
      min-width: 64px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 7px 9px;
      color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      font: 800 0.9rem/1 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .metric-card {
      display: grid;
      align-content: center;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .metric-label {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .metric-value {
      font-size: 1.42rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .metric-subvalue {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }

    .abc-status {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      box-shadow: none;
    }

    .abc-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 0.85fr);
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .abc-plot-card {
      min-width: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .abc-plot-head {
      padding: 14px 16px 0;
    }

    .abc-plot-head p {
      margin: 5px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .abc-scatter { height: 520px; }
    .abc-curves { height: 520px; }

    .method-note {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .method-note article {
      padding: 15px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #fbfcfd;
    }

    .method-note p {
      margin: 6px 0 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .mono-inline {
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    }


    .mcmc-controls {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(175px, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: stretch;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .mcmc-target-card { grid-column: span 2; }

    .mcmc-action-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px 16px;
      align-items: center;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
    }

    .mcmc-action-row .small-note {
      margin: 0;
      flex: 1 1 360px;
    }

    .mcmc-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .mcmc-path { height: 560px; }
    .mcmc-traces { height: 610px; }

    .metric-value.compact {
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .status.stale .status-dot {
      background: var(--warning);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(122, 84, 16, 0.12);
    }

    .status.running .status-dot {
      background: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(40, 95, 143, 0.13);
      animation: pulse 1.25s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { transform: scale(0.9); opacity: 0.75; }
      50% { transform: scale(1.15); opacity: 1; }
    }

    .settings-inline {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 8px 18px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .settings-inline div {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      padding-bottom: 6px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .settings-inline dt { color: var(--muted); }
    .settings-inline dd { margin: 0; font-weight: 800; }

    @media (max-width: 1180px) {
      .abc-controls, .mcmc-controls { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .mcmc-target-card { grid-column: span 2; }
      .abc-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .abc-scatter, .abc-curves { height: 470px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .header-actions { justify-content: flex-start; }
      .abc-controls,
      .mcmc-controls,
      .method-note { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .mcmc-target-card { grid-column: span 1; }
      .settings-inline { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .abc-scatter, .abc-curves { height: 430px; }
      .mcmc-path { height: 470px; }
      .mcmc-traces { height: 560px; }
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 26px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1050px) {
      .scenario-grid,
      .interpretation,
      .observed-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .chart { height: 380px; }
      .observed-chart { min-height: 430px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      main { width: min(100% - 20px, 1480px); padding-top: 26px; }
      header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; align-items: start; }
      header button { justify-self: start; }
      .panel { padding: 17px; }
      .panel-head { display: block; }
      .formula { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <header>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Approximate Bayesian Computation dashboard · build step 4</p>
        <h1>ABC-MCMC: a dependent random walk through the ABC posterior</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Step 4 adds a 6,500-iteration ABC-MCMC chain to the cached rejection sample. The chain uses an explicit Gaussian random-walk proposal, retains the current state after rejection, discards 500 burn-in iterations, and renders its path and parameter traces while it runs.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="header-actions">
        <button id="resimulate-abc" type="button">New seed + rerun all inference</button>
        <button id="rerun" class="button-secondary" type="button">Rerun validation</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div id="status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">
      <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span id="status-text">Preparing validation runs…</span>
    </div>

    <aside class="scope-note">
      <strong>Steps 1–4 complete; scope stops before the combined comparison panel.</strong>
      Panel 2 implements ABC-MCMC directly rather than calling an inference package. Its accepted moves depend on the previous chain state; a rejected proposal leaves an exact repeated state in the chain. The fixed observed epidemic remains unchanged.
    </aside>

    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="observed-title">
      <div class="panel-head">
        <div>
          <h2 id="observed-title">Hard-fixed observed epidemic</h2>
          <p>One stochastic run generated once from the ground truth, β<sub>true</sub> = 0.4 and γ<sub>true</sub> = 0.1. Every later comparison will use these exact stored values.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="fixed-badge">Embedded, not regenerated</span>
      </div>

      <div class="observed-layout">
        <div id="observed-chart" class="observed-chart" aria-label="Fixed observed SIR epidemic trajectory"></div>
        <div class="summary-stack">
          <article class="summary-card accent">
            <h3>Rich summary</h3>
            <dl class="stat-list">
              <dt>Peak infection height</dt><dd id="observed-peak-height">—</dd>
              <dt>Peak timing</dt><dd id="observed-peak-day">—</dd>
              <dt>Final epidemic size</dt><dd id="observed-final-size">—</dd>
            </dl>
            <div id="rich-vector" class="vector">—</div>
          </article>

          <article class="summary-card">
            <h3>Poor summary</h3>
            <p class="small-note">Intentionally discards the height and timing of the epidemic peak.</p>
            <div id="poor-vector" class="vector">—</div>
          </article>

          <article class="summary-card">
            <h3>Fixed-data provenance</h3>
            <dl class="stat-list">
              <dt>Offline generation seed</dt><dd id="observed-seed">—</dd>
              <dt>Horizon</dt><dd>100 days</dd>
              <dt>Population</dt><dd>1,000</dd>
              <dt>Basic reproduction ratio</dt><dd>4.0</dd>
            </dl>
            <p class="small-note">The seed documents provenance only. Reloading the page reads stored arrays and does not call the simulator for the observed curve.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>



    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="rejection-title">
      <div class="panel-head">
        <div>
          <h2 id="rejection-title">Panel 1 — Naive ABC rejection sampling</h2>
          <p>Each proposal is an independent draw from β ∼ Uniform(0.05, 1.0) and γ ∼ Uniform(0.02, 0.5). A proposal is accepted only when its simulated summary lies within ε of the fixed observed summary.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="fixed-badge">4,000 cached simulations</span>
      </div>

      <div id="abc-status" class="status abc-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">
        <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span id="abc-status-text">Preparing the rejection-sampling batch…</span>
      </div>

      <div class="abc-controls">
        <div class="control-card">
          <span class="control-label">Summary statistic</span>
          <div class="segmented" role="radiogroup" aria-label="ABC summary statistic">
            <label>
              <input type="radio" name="abc-summary" value="rich" checked>
              <span>Rich: peak, day, final</span>
            </label>
            <label>
              <input type="radio" name="abc-summary" value="poor">
              <span>Poor: final only</span>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="control-card">
          <label for="epsilon-slider">Tolerance ε</label>
          <div class="range-row">
            <input id="epsilon-slider" type="range" min="0.005" max="0.250" step="0.005" value="0.080">
            <output id="epsilon-value" class="epsilon-readout" for="epsilon-slider">0.080</output>
          </div>
          <p class="small-note">Normalized Euclidean distance: heights and final sizes divide by N; peak timing divides by T.</p>
        </div>

        <article class="metric-card">
          <span class="metric-label">Acceptance rate</span>
          <strong id="abc-acceptance-rate" class="metric-value">—</strong>
          <span id="abc-accepted-count" class="metric-subvalue">—</span>
        </article>

        <article class="metric-card">
          <span class="metric-label">Simulation budget</span>
          <strong id="abc-budget" class="metric-value">4,000</strong>
          <span class="metric-subvalue">one SIR run per proposal</span>
        </article>

        <article class="metric-card">
          <span class="metric-label">Current batch seed</span>
          <strong id="abc-seed" class="metric-value mono-inline">—</strong>
          <span id="abc-batch-time" class="metric-subvalue">not yet simulated</span>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="abc-layout">
        <article class="abc-plot-card">
          <div class="abc-plot-head">
            <h3>Prior proposals and tolerance filter</h3>
            <p>The slider recolors cached proposals; it does not run the simulator again.</p>
          </div>
          <div id="abc-scatter" class="abc-scatter" aria-label="ABC rejection proposals in beta gamma parameter space"></div>
        </article>

        <article class="abc-plot-card">
          <div class="abc-plot-head">
            <h3>Accepted epidemic trajectories</h3>
            <p>Up to eight closest accepted cached curves are overlaid on the fixed observed I(t).</p>
          </div>
          <div id="abc-curves" class="abc-curves" aria-label="Accepted simulated infected trajectories over observed epidemic"></div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="method-note">
        <article>
          <h3>Independent proposals</h3>
          <p>Every point comes directly from the prior. Rejected proposals do not influence the next draw.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Cached interaction</h3>
          <p>β, γ, all I(t) values, and raw summaries are stored once. Changing ε only filters; changing summary type only recomputes distances.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Lossy summaries</h3>
          <p>The poor statistic ignores peak height and timing, so many dynamically different outbreaks can pass the same tolerance.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>


    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="mcmc-title">
      <div class="panel-head">
        <div>
          <h2 id="mcmc-title">Panel 2 — ABC-MCMC</h2>
          <p>A Gaussian random walk proposes nearby parameter values. Within the uniform-prior bounds, a proposal becomes the next state only when a fresh stochastic epidemic has normalized summary distance below ε; otherwise the chain stays exactly where it was.</p>
        </div>
        <span class="fixed-badge">6,500 iterations · 500 burn-in</span>
      </div>

      <div id="mcmc-status" class="status abc-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">
        <span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span id="mcmc-status-text">Waiting for the cached rejection batch before starting ABC-MCMC…</span>
      </div>

      <div class="mcmc-controls">
        <div class="control-card mcmc-target-card">
